  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  NormTruncCDFc
  @  Upper tail at X.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 5; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 5 ≠ THEN "NormTruncCDFc: needs 5 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → x0v scv Xminv Xmaxv Xv « x0v 0 + scv 0 + Xminv 0 + Xmaxv 0 + Xv 0 + → x0 sc Xmin Xmax X « '1-(IFTE(X≤Xmin;0;IFTE(X≥Xmax;1;(erf((X-x0)/(sc*√(2)))-erf((Xmin-x0)/(sc*√(2))))/(erf((Xmax-x0)/(sc*√(2)))-erf((Xmin-x0)/(sc*√(2)))))))' →Num x0v scv Xminv Xmaxv Xv 5 →List Drop » »
